  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In current l-test (1468) and live (1470), MM > Settings > Control are using string 97186 as the Escape key name. \n\nHowever, it is the name of a key on the keyboard, in many localized translations it has kept in the original language as \"Esc\", which is different from the logic of 97186, \"abort and return\". So it should be 23359.\n\n- 97186: In-world purchases, creator economy\n\n- 23359: Escape key name, MM QM Settings",
